{"id":"P051-1","subject":"P","unit":"P051","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P051-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n1C의 점전하가 자속밀도 m내에서\n\nms의 속도로 운동하고 있을 때, 점전하\n\n에 작용하는 힘은 몇 N 인가?\n\n\n\n\n①      ② \n\n③     ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1235}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n공기중에서 직경이 1m인 독립된 금속 구도체의 정전용\n\n량은 몇 F인가?\n\n\n     \n①            ②      \n\n     \n③            ④      ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":676},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1834}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n진공 중에서 서로 떨어져 있는 구도체 A와 B가 있다.\n\nA에만 2C의 전하를 주었을 때, A의 전위는 5V, B