옳은\n\n것은?\n\n  직류 발전기의 무부하 포화곡선은 ( ㉠  )과 계자\n\n  전류의 관계를 나타내는 곡선이며, 부하 포화곡선은\n\n    ( ㉡  )과 계자전류의 관계를 나타내는 곡선이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①     유기기전력       단자전압\n\n ②     단자전압       유기기전력\n\n ③     부하전류        단자전압\n\n ④     단자전압        부하전류","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":703},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1263}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n전기자 저항이 0.1Ω인 직류 분권 전동기의 단자전압이\n\n210V, 부하전류가 100A 인 경우의 토크는 몇 N⦁m\n\n인가? (단, 전동기의 회전속도는 1000rpm이다.)\n\n\n                       \n①            ②       \n\n                       \n③            ④       ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":705},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":619},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m17-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1573}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 18번","searchText":